Cell["\<\
The *funcList aggregators return all orders 0..m at once: \
bosonicminusfuncList and fermionicplusfuncList each give a {beta-row, \
alpha-row} of shape 2 \[Times] (m+1); functionalpair bundles both (shape 2 \
\[Times] 2 \[Times] (m+1)) \[LongDash] exactly the object generate1ptmx maps \
over the \[CapitalDelta] grid.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cb30df43-08d8-42c9-ace3-7355d99d0157"],

